3
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,320
Either

4
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:14,240
we don't know which is the old store,

5
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,520
or we know which one it is,

6
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,450
but don't know the exact location.

7
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:19,480
What should we do?

8
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:20,640
Yeah.

9
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:22,480
Looking for so long

10
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:25,480
makes me dizzier.

11
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:31,280
What?

12
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:34,080
I,

13
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:37,000
I feel a bit dizzy.

14
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,080
I want

15
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,640
