Drinking more water is good for you.

22
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:08,800
Finish it.

23
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,120
Drink up.

24
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:22,900
The water is a bit cold.

25
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,520
A bit cold?

26
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,460
Then I'll get you a refill.

27
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,740
With hot water.

28
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,900
I want a refill too.

29
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,040
Boss,

30
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,450
