31
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,120
What is this?

32
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,079
Drink water.

33
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:00,800
Drink water.

34
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,240
A pet button?

35
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,880
I... I don't need it, do I?

36
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:08,920
Of course you do.

37
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,800
You're coughing so badly.

38
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,120
This is what the boss

39
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,640
prepared especially for pets.

40
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,240
I specifically bought one from him.

41
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:18,520
This is a gift for you.

42
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,120
It saves you the trouble of speaking,

43
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,380
and me the trouble of not understanding.

44
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,720
Li Xinyue, you're ruthless.

45
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:31,320
Thank you.

46
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:34,240
Thank you.

47
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,320
You're welcome.

48
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,240
Queen.

49
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,880
This shop is real.

50
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,600
Queen.

51
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,840
Queen.

52
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,200
Queen.

53
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,240
Queen.

54
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,680
No, what did you

55
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,160
just record?

56
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,200
Queen.

57
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,640
Queen.

58
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,400
Have you had enough?

59
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,720
Have you really never thought about

60
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:07,850
how we'll face the clients if we can't find Master Huang?

61
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,600
Don't worry, my queen.

62
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,240
Don't worry, my queen.

63
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,240
Don't worry, my queen.

64
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,000
Don't worry, my queen.

65
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,840
Really?

66
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,200
Thank you. Thank you.

67
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:32,930
We'll be right there. Thank you for your trouble.

68
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,400
I found it. I found it.

69
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,880
They said there is an old man from the neighborhood committee

70
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,000
who knows Master Huang very well.

71
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,400
He'll take us there in a minute.

72
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,880
Great. Let's hurry.

73
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,360
Let's set off right away.

74
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:52,400
Zhang Yang, let's see how long you can keep pretending.

75
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,320
All visitors are guests.

76
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:18,840
Unfortunately, I haven't opened the shop for a long time.

77
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,760
I don't have much to serve you.

78
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,600
I'll make a plate of Powan for you.

79
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,760
Fried Powan.

80
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,680
Not at all.

81
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,720
Mr. Huang, you are too polite.

82
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,240
We are the ones being presumptuous.

83
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,800
To smell such an aroma,

84
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,400
it's our blessing.

85
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,880
Please don't say that.

86
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,800
In the past,

87
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:42,920
many folks who went to Taiwan

88
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:45,090
would bring my Powan with them.

89
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,480
They said eating it

90
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:49,320
brought back the taste of their hometown.

91
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,720
It's fine.

92
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,400
Let me tell you.

93
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,480
For us Minnan people,

94
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:02,680
especially here in Shishan,

95
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:06,880
this dish is a must for weddings and banquets.

96
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,120
It symbolizes

97
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,480
reunion

98
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,480
and prosperity.

99
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,760
Come, taste it

100
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,560
and see if it's the right flavor.

101
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,060
Thank you, Master.

102
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:19,520
Thank you.

103
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:32,520
Delicious.

104
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,440
The crust is so crispy,

105
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,880
and the inside is bouncy and tender.

106
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:37,240
It tastes really good.

107
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,520
I'm glad you like it.

108
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,250
I'm glad you like it.

109
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,120
Sir,

110
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,920
you have such great skills

111
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,400
and so much energy.

112
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,360
Besides,

113
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:52,600
so many people want to find your flavors.

114
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:54,880
Someone even asked us to find you.

115
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:58,120
With your skills, you should have been living in a luxury apartment long ago.

116
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,720
Staying at home like this

117
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,180
feels like you're just throwing money away.

118
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,280
Sorry, sir.

119
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,280
I'm being a bit presumptuous, aren't I?

120
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,520
It's fine.

121
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:13,620
Young lady.

122
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,040
Let me ask you,

123
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:18,080
why do you help people find shops?

124
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:23,920
For my job. To make money.

125
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:27,040
And why do you want to make money?

126
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,800
After making money...

127
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,600
to buy a house,

128
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:36,280
have savings, and live a comfortable life.

129
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,010
Once you have property,

130
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,440
savings,

131
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:43,040
and a stable life,

132
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,080
what then?

133
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,159
What do you want to do the most?

134
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:49,400
What do I want to do the most?

135
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,970
I want to sit quietly at home and watch the sunset,

136
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,320
make some tea,

137
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,800
play some of my favorite songs,

138
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,880
and keep a cat.

139
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,480
Or

140
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:09,280
I'll just

141
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,120
sit and zone out

142
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,250
without thinking about anything.

143
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:17,880
This is exactly the kind of life I'm living right now.

144
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:31,520
Come.

145
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:32,520
Eat up.

146
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:34,440
Thank you.

147
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:47,840
So you have already met the master.

148
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:50,600
Are you going to take the clients directly to him next?

149
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:52,040
No.

150
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:54,080
If there's a first time, there will be a second time.

151
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,000
So I think

152
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,640
the master probably doesn't want others to

153
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,840
disturb his life.

154
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:00,840
It's really not like you to pass up making money.

155
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,600
In the world,

156
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:04,440
there are still many things more important than money.

157
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,000
Right?

158
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,800
You don't understand.

159
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,480
I specifically asked the master

160
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,680
to pack a box for the client.

161
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:14,480
After eating it, the client loved it so much

162
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,440
that they directly booked our nostalgia tour.

163
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,800
The most expensive package.

164
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,240
That's more like you.

165
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,480
The most expensive one.

166
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,880
Xinyue, you are amazing.

167
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,570
What do you mean?

168
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,280
Can't you see me?

169
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:35,880
We see you. Aren't you right here?

170
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,560
Zhang Yang, Qin Fei and I will take this order.

171
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,800
You get a good rest.

172
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,400
Yes, get a good rest.

173
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:45,000
Think of it as a thank you for getting soaked in the rain that day

174
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,400
while giving the umbrella to Xinyue and me.

175
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:52,520
You reminded me.

176
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:53,480
Zhang Yang.

177
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:59,720
I must thank you properly.

178
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:21,240
She invited an old doctor of traditional Chinese medicine to her home,

179
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,960
and paid for it herself.

180
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,200
She is so generous recently.

181
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,560
What are you laughing at?

182
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,200
The doctor she found

183
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,880
was recommended by me.

184
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:47,360
Okay.

185
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,640
And then?

186
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:50,100
Do you want me to thank you?

187
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:57,240
That doctor is very good at acupuncture.

188
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,800
Acupuncture.

189
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,480
Zhang Yang.

190
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,680
Zhang Yang.

191
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,760
I suddenly feel much better.

192
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,820
There's no need to bother the doctor.

193
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,080
Don't hide your illness from the doctor,

194
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,320
Mr. Zhang.

195
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:23,160
No.

196
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,760
I'm telling the truth.

197
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,480
Look at me, I'm even sweating.

198
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,760
It's cold sweat.

199
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:29,640
You are still weak,

200
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:30,520
not fully recovered.

201
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:32,000
I am fully recovered.

202
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,200
Absolutely.

203
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:33,960
Really?

204
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,360
Yesterday you couldn't even lift a finger,

205
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:39,440
and today you are alive and kicking. You're not coughing,

206
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,440
and your voice is not hoarse either.

207
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:46,240
I was making steady progress.

208
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,160
Then you're still not fully recovered.

209
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,200
Don't worry.

210
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:52,040
This master is highly experienced.

211
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,240
His technique is very professional.

212
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,680
Such a long needle,

213
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:56,040
swish, goes right in.

214
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:58,020
Not a single drop of blood.

215
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,280
Master, I'll leave him to you.

216
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,840
Don't go easy on him.

217
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,840
He is very sick.

218
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:12,160
Master, please come in.

219
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:13,720
Li Xinyue.

220
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,440
Li Xinyue, I was wrong.

221
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,680
I'm really not sick.

222
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:19,320
I was just faking it to make you feel sorry for me.

223
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:21,320
I don't want to be mad at you anymore.

224
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,920
When you were ordering me around yesterday,

225
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,040
weren't you having a great time?

226
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,680
That was just us partners helping each other out,

227
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,000
building rapport.

228
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:30,680
It hurts!

229
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:31,480
Li Xinyue.

230
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,440
So energetic.

231
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,340
Your voice isn't hoarse anymore.

232
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,240
Let's go.

233
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:38,000
I'll treat you to half-price milk tea for the second cup,

234
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:38,400
okay?

235
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:40,760
It's really not hoarse anymore.

236
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:42,280
I'll treat you to the second cup.

237
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:43,480
This is effective.

238
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,680
A miracle doctor!

239
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:46,960
Master, push a little harder.

240
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:49,360
Harder. He's very sick.

241
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:51,680
He's fine. He can take it.
